# Direct OCR tools used by the shared local-ocr skill.
# Homebrew resolves OCRmyPDF's runtime dependencies (including Python and Ghostscript).
# Validated OCR baseline: OCRmyPDF 17.13.0, Poppler 26.06.0, Tesseract 5.5.3,
# and tesseract-lang 4.1.0. These versions are recorded, not pinned.
# Local helper CLIs: ripgrep for fast searches and ImageMagick for image utilities.
brew "ocrmypdf"
brew "poppler"
brew "ripgrep"
brew "imagemagick"
brew "tesseract"
brew "tesseract-lang"
